  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself or a loved one in faith and comfort with this personalized Jeminise Christian Blanket. Blending a soft, skin-friendly fabric with uplifting scripture, this blanket offers warmth, peace, and daily encouragement, making it a truly heartfelt and inspirational gift for any believer.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An inspirational religious throw blanket with bible verses, perfect for celebrating faith on birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Add a name or date to create a one-of-a-kind keepsake, ideal for those who cherish personalized, faith-filled items.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Made with soft, skin-friendly fabric, designed to provide peace and encouragement during prayer and quiet times.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit various needs and preferences.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is machine washable for convenient cleaning and maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Recommended for indoor use, perfect for adding a touch of spiritual comfort to any home.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
